  (text
    "stman: the transceivers U8 (receive, pair 1/2) and U9 (send, pair 3/6) are on the cable's side,\nsupplied from the cable (SS_5V, SS_GND); ISO7331FC U200 (outputs low while unpowered) is the only path to the MCU.\nU10, U11 (pairs 4/5, 7/8) removed: those pairs carry the cable's +5 V and GND (JP200, JP201: check against the Mesa card *)"
